ns — kids choose it over YouTube</span>\n    </li>\n    <li class=\"pib-bullet\">\n      <span class=\"pib-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\">✔</span>\n      <span>Perfect for ages 6–12, gift-ready hardcover packaging</span>\n    </li>\n  </ul>\n\n</div>\n\n<style>\n\n  .pib-wrap *,\n  .pib-wrap *::before,\n  .pib-wrap *::after {\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n\n  .pib-wrap {\n    font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;\n    color: #0d1b3e;\n    width: 100%;\n    max-width: 560px;\n  }\n\n  .pib-carousel {\n    position: relative;\n    background: #ffffff;\n    border: 1px solid rgba(13,27,62,0.08);\n    border-radius: 14px;\n    padding: 22px 22px 16px 22px;\n    margin-bottom: 22px;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    box-shadow:\n      0 1px 3px rgba(13,27,62,0.04),\n      0 4px 16px rgba(13,27,62,0.06);\n  }\n\n  .pib-carousel__bg-quote {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: -10px;\n    right: 14px;\n    font-size: 100px;\n    font-family: Georgia, serif;\n    color: rgba(13,27,62,0.04);\n    line-height: 1;\n    pointer-events: none;\n    user-select: none;\n  }\n\n  .pib-slides {\n    position: relative;\n    min-height: 96px;\n  }\n\n  .pib-slide {\n    display: none;\n    animation: pibFadeIn 0.5s ease;\n  }\n  .pib-slide.active {\n    display: block;\n  }\n\n  @keyframes pibFadeIn {\n    from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(6px); }\n    to   { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }\n  }\n\n  .pib-slide__text {\n    font-size: 14px;\n    font-style: italic;\n    color: #1a1a2e;\n    line-height: 1.65;\n    margin: 0 0 14px 0;\n  }\n\n  .pib-slide__author {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 10px;\n  }\n\n  .pib-slide__avatar {\n    width: 36px;\n    height: 36px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    object-fit: cover;\n    border: 2px solid rgba(13,27,62,0.08);\n    flex-shrink: 0;\n    display: block;\n  }\n\n  .pib-slide__name {\n    font-size: 13px;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    color: #0d1b3e;\n    line-height: 1.2;\n    margin-bottom: 3px;\n  }\n\n  .pib-slide__meta {\n    font-size: 11.5px;\n    color: #9ca3af;\n    font-weight: 500;\n    line-height: 1;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 4px;\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n  }\n\n  .pib-slide__stars {\n    color: #f59e0b;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n    line-height: 1;\n  }\n\n  .pib-dots {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 6px;\n    justify-content: center;\n    margin-top: 14px;\n  }\n  .pib-dot {\n    width: 7px;\n    height: 7px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background: rgba(13,27,62,0.12);\n    cursor: pointer;\n    transition: background 0.25s ease, transform 0.25s ease;\n    display: inline-block;\n  }\n  .pib-dot.active {\n    background: #0d1b3e;\n    transform: scale(1.35);\n  }\n  .pib-dot:hover {\n    background: rgba(13,27,62,0.3);\n  }\n\n  .pib-scarcity {\n    display: inline-flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 8px;\n    background: #fff3cd;\n    border: 1px solid #f5a623;\n    color: #92400e;\n    border-radius: 8px;\n    padding: 8px 14px;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    margin-bottom: 18px;\n    line-height: 1;\n  }\n\n  .pib-scarcity__pulse {\n    width: 8px;\n    height: 8px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background: #c0392b;\n    flex-shrink: 0;\n    display: inline-block;\n    animation: pibPulse 1.8s ease-in-out infinite;\n  }\n  @keyframes pibPulse {\n    0%   { box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(192,57,43,0.5); }\n    70%  { box-shadow: 0 0 0 7px rgba(192,57,43,0); }\n    100% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(192,57,43,0); }\n  }\n\n  .pib-title {\n    font-size: clamp(21px, 3.5vw, 27px);\n    font-weight: 900;\n    line-height: 1.18;\n    letter-spacing: -0.5px;\n    color: #0d1b3e;\n    margin: 0 0 16px 0;\n  }\n\n  .pib-stars-row {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 7px;\n    margin-bottom: 20px;\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n    cursor: pointer;\n  }\n  .pib-stars {\n    color: #f59e0b;\n    font-size: 16px;\n    letter-spacing: 1.5px;\n    line