        "visibility": "always-display",
        "custom_liquid": "<div class=\"imt-wrap\">\n\n  <div class=\"imt-inner\">\n\n    <div class=\"imt-eyebrow\">\n      <span class=\"imt-eyebrow__dot\"></span>\n      Why 18,000+ families chose this book\n    </div>\n\n    <h2 class=\"imt-heading\">\n      The Book That Answers <span class=\"imt-highlight\">Every Question</span> Your Child Has Ever Asked\n    </h2>\n\n    <p class=\"imt-sub\">\n      Not a textbook. Not a reference tool. A book children pick up because they want to — and can't put down.\n    </p>\n\n    <ul class=\"imt-features\">\n      <li class=\"imt-feature\">\n        <div class=\"imt-feature__icon\">🧠</div>\n        <div class=\"imt-feature__body\">\n          <div class=\"imt-feature__title\">Real Questions Kids Actually Ask</div>\n          <div class=\"imt-feature__desc\">The ones children wonder about every single day — not what adults think they should know</div>\n        </div>\n      </li>\n      <li class=\"imt-feature\">\n        <div class=\"imt-feature__icon\">🚀</div>\n        <div class=\"imt-feature__body\">\n          <div class=\"imt-feature__title\">Everything In One Book</div>\n          <div class=\"imt-feature__desc\">Animals, space, the human body, nature, technology, daily life and more</div>\n        </div>\n      </li>\n      <li class=\"imt-feature\">\n        <div class=\"imt-feature__icon\">📵</div>\n        <div class=\"imt-feature__body\">\n          <div class=\"imt-feature__title\">Competes With Screens</div>\n          <div class=\"imt-feature__desc\">Kids choose it voluntarily — parents call it the only thing that works</div>\n        </div>\n      </li>\n      <li class=\"imt-feature\">\n        <div class=\"imt-feature__icon\">⭐</div>\n        <div class=\"imt-feature__body\">\n          <div class=\"imt-feature__title\">Ages 6–12</div>\n          <div class=\"imt-feature__desc\">Written simply, illustrated beautifully, built to be read for fun</div>\n        </div>\n      </li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <div class=\"imt-proof\">\n      <div class=\"imt-proof__stars\">★★★★★</div>\n      <p class=\"imt-proof__quote\">\"His teacher called to say he was the most engaged student in class. All from a book he found on the coffee table.\"</p>\n      <span class=\"imt-proof__author\">— Rachel M., Mom of two · Verified buyer</span>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n\n<style>\n\n  .imt-wrap *,\n  .imt-wrap *::before,\n  .imt-wrap *::after {\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n  }\n\n  .imt-wrap {\n    font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;\n    width: 100%;\n    background: transparent;\n    color: #0d1b3e;\n    padding: 48px 16px;\n  }\n\n  .imt-inner {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n    width: 100%;\n    max-width: 600px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n  }\n\n  .imt-eyebrow {\n    display: inline-flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 8px;\n    background: #dcfce7;\n    color: #166534;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    letter-spacing: 0.05em;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    padding: 6px 14px;\n    border-radius: 100px;\n    margin-bottom: 16px;\n    line-height: 1;\n    flex-shrink: 0;\n  }\n\n  .imt-eyebrow__dot {\n    width: 6px;\n    height: 6px;\n    min-width: 6px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background: #166534;\n    flex-shrink: 0;\n    display: block;\n  }\n\n  .imt-heading {\n    font-size: clamp(20px, 3vw, 28px);\n    font-weight: 900;\n    line-height: 1.22;\n    letter-spacing: -0.4px;\n    color: #0d1b3e;\n    margin-bottom: 12px;\n    width: 100%;\n    word-break: break-word;\n    hyphens: none;\n  }\n\n  .imt-highlight {\n    display: inline;\n    background: #f5a623;\n    color: #0d1b3e;\n    border-radius: 5px;\n    padding: 1px 7px;\n    font-style: normal;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    -webkit-box-decoration-break: clone;\n    box-decoration-break: clone;\n  }\n\n  .imt-sub {\n    font-size: clamp(13px, 1.6vw, 15px);\n    line-height: 1.7;\n    color: #6b7280;\n    margin-bottom: 24px;\n    width: 100%;\n  }\n\n  .imt-features {\n    list-style: none;\n    width: 100%;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    gap: 13px;\n    margin-bottom: 24px;\n  }\n\n  .imt-feature {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n    gap: 12px;\n    width: 100%;\n  }\n\n  .imt-feature__icon {\n    width: 38px;\n    height: 38px;\n    min-width: 38px;\n    background: #ffffff;\n    border: 1px solid rgba(13,27,62,0.08);\n    border-radius: 10px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    font-size: 17px;\n    box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(13,27,62,0.06);\n    flex-shrink: 0;\n    line-height: 1;\n  }\n\n  .imt-feature__body {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    gap: 4px;\n    padding-top: 2px;\n    min-width: 0;\n    flex: 1;\n  }\n\n  .imt-feature__title {\n    font-size: clamp(13px, 1.6vw, 14px);\n    font-weight: 800;\n    color: #0d1b3e;\n    line-height: 1.25;\n    word-break: break-word;\n  }\n\n  .imt-feature__desc {\n    font-size: clamp(12px, 1.4vw, 13px);\n    color: #6b7280;\n    line-height: 1.55;\n    font-weight: 500;\n    word-break: break-word;\n  }\n\n  .imt-proof {\n    width: 100%;\n    background: #ffffff;\n    border: 1px solid rgba(13,27,62,0.08);\n    border-left: 3px solid #c0392b;\n    border-radius: 0 12px 12px 0;\n    padding: 15px 16px;\n    box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(13,27,62,0.06);\n  }\n\n  .imt-proof__stars {\n    color: #f59e0b;\n    font-size: 12.5px;\n    letter-spacing: 1.5px;\n    margin-bottom: 8px;\n    line-height: 1;\n    display: block;\n  }\n\n  .imt-proof__quote {\n    font-size: clamp(12.5px, 1.6vw, 13.5px);\n    font-style: italic;\n    color: #1a1a2e;\n    line-height: 1.68;\n    margin-bottom: 8px;\n    word-break: break-word;\n  }\n\n  .imt-proof__author {\n    font-size: clamp(11px, 1.3vw, 12px);\n    color: #9ca3af;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    display: block;\n    line-height: 1;\n  }\n\n  @media (max-width: 480px) {\n    .imt-wrap { padding: 36px 16px; }\n    .imt-eyebrow { font-size: 10.5px; padding: 5px 12px; margin-bottom: 14px; }\n    .imt-heading { font-size: 20px; letter-spacing: -0.3px; margin-bottom: 11px; }\n    .imt-sub { font-size: 13.5px; margin-bottom: 20px; }\n    .imt-features { gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 22px; }\n    .imt-feature__icon { width: 34px; height: 34px; min-width: 34px; font-size: 15px; border-radius: 8px; }\n    .imt-feature__title { font-size: 13px; }\n    .imt-feature__desc { font-size: 12px; }\n    .imt-proof { padding: 13px; border-radius: 0 10px 10px 0; }\n    .imt-proof__quote { font-size: 12.5px; }\n    .imt-proof__author { font-size: 11px; }\n  }\n\n  @media (max-width: 360px) {\n    .imt-wrap { padding: 32px 12px; }\n    .imt-heading { font-size: 19px; }\n    .imt-sub { font-size: 13px; }\n    .imt-feature__title { font-size: 12.5px; }\n    .imt-feature__desc { font-size: 11.5px; }\n  }\n\n</style>",
